        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-02-05T23:53:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Two tries and two failures so far. Second try got him down to 2 with 15 cards in the trash. I wish I'd realized the Throwing Knives thing earlier, especially since Wraith can keep Nightmist in cards all game.</p>\n<p>At least I learned that, if you get rid of the Backlash Field&nbsp;<em>eventually</em>, you can survive with even Tempest in the game and no Cleansing Downpour necessary. Though I did play a Vernal Sonata so I could Rebel Yell him without killing him. I think Argent Adept did more damage to Tempest than Blade did...</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:08.519Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
